# Every repository is pinned to a full commit. Do not replace `version` with
# `main`, a branch name or a moving tag in a release/test manifest.
# PX4 and px4_msgs are pinned to the dereferenced commits of their official
# v1.17.0 tags. Do not replace these commits with a custom fork without a new
# architecture/dependency decision.
